# --- the three remaining translation units as Verified Software Units,
# then the link. internal/vst/sha256/vsu.v (above) is the fourth. Each vsu/ file
# packages its TU's body proofs; link.v joins all four into one component
# with Imports nil, exporting the three public entry points.
internal/vst/util/component.v
internal/vst/thash/component.v
internal/vst/wots/component.v
internal/vst/link.v

